{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have entered the Feywood looking for a monstrous beast spreading destruction into the world, withering it away. But success will be no easy feat, the forest is full of enemies stopping your advance!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mysterious powers found within the forest, work together with its denizens to unleash incredible abilities, and delve deep through its many branches to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deadly Tactical Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be thoughtful of your approach to the turn-based battles, powerful enemies lurk everywhere in the dungeon, so you must use every resource you can to survive. It's up to you how to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extract your precious loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is costly, you will lose everything you're carrying and start all over. After completing an area, however, you will be able to stash anything you looted from the forest, and keep it for next runs. Some of the denizens of the forest may also help you extract your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find and unlock powerful and unique items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts beyond imagination can be found in the forest, collect them and use their incredible power in battle, and unlock items found in the forest to be used later on... if you can pay the price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Interact with helpful denizens of the Feywood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mysteries hide within the Feywood, including wanderers that live within in, helping you along the way with gifts, items for sale or special events. Ask for their help if you choose to do so, or challenge them to duels to prove yourself and get their items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless build possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as anything you want, from a minotaur berserker jumping straight into the fray, to a book wielding spellcasting elf ready to fling spells at their enemies, or a sneaky goblin hidding from their enemies and killing from the shadows, or a druid fighting with animal companions. Use any combination of classes, abilities and equipment, it's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Class System:</strong> Choose from many different classes to unlock amazing power, and mix and match as you see fit to create your own character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Roguelike:</strong> All the depth of a traditional roguelike, with a modern and beautiful interface that makes it very easy to play with a mouse or controller, but deep and hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Dungeon:</strong> Explore the procedurally-generated forest and its many areas, from snowy valleys to lush jungles and barren deserts, each with its own challenges and enemies to face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Crafting: </strong>Make your equipment stronger by crafting runes into them, and use special items to randomize their modifiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Feywood and venture forward!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819720?t=1767713640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819720?t=1767713640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/6d6d42c5b9d19ee5307c580b88c4551cf2a2d63a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767713640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/6d6d42c5b9d19ee5307c580b88c4551cf2a2d63a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767713640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4022940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have entered the Feywood looking for a monstrous beast spreading destruction into the world, withering it away. But success will be no easy feat, the forest is full of enemies stopping your advance!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mysterious powers found within the forest, work together with its denizens to unleash incredible abilities, and delve deep through its many branches to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deadly Tactical Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/f7f44a34f34ea6fe83faa25ec19f164d.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be thoughtful of your approach to the turn-based battles, powerful enemies lurk everywhere in the dungeon, so you must use every resource you can to survive. It's up to you how to defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Extract your precious loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/e12ddb610aef3dea226e6b62e936b8d6.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is costly, you will lose everything you're carrying and start all over. After completing an area, however, you will be able to stash anything you looted from the forest, and keep it for next runs. Some of the denizens of the forest may also help you extract your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find and unlock powerful and unique items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/6e957be076abf833b5a3006aefef4cba.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts beyond imagination can be found in the forest, collect them and use their incredible power in battle, and unlock items found in the forest to be used later on... if you can pay the price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Interact with helpful denizens of the Feywood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c6cda34c9a0c4b617bb22c2b5c4e4aad.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mysteries hide within the Feywood, including wanderers that live within in, helping you along the way with gifts, items for sale or special events. Ask for their help if you choose to do so, or challenge them to duels to prove yourself and get their items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endless build possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.poster.avif?t=1767713640\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.webm?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/extras/c9d82294a88db50106712822e3820236.mp4?t=1767713640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as anything you want, from a minotaur berserker jumping straight into the fray, to a book wielding spellcasting elf ready to fling spells at their enemies, or a sneaky goblin hidding from their enemies and killing from the shadows, or a druid fighting with animal companions. Use any combination of classes, abilities and equipment, it's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Class System:</strong> Choose from many different classes to unlock amazing power, and mix and match as you see fit to create your own character.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Roguelike:</strong> All the depth of a traditional roguelike, with a modern and beautiful interface that makes it very easy to play with a mouse or controller, but deep and hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Dungeon:</strong> Explore the procedurally-generated forest and its many areas, from snowy valleys to lush jungles and barren deserts, each with its own challenges and enemies to face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Crafting: </strong>Make your equipment stronger by crafting runes into them, and use special items to randomize their modifiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Feywood and venture forward!</p>","developers":["Vicente Miranda"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819720/1d4d8e991ee5806654fb39da4ca0d0958a92d85b/header.jpg?t=1767713640","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819720/137019475/d467cab737c6436af944774cf24cd731ce048437/1757420145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757425643","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819720/137019475/d467cab737c6436af944774cf24cd731ce048437/1757420145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757425643","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3819720/137019475/d467cab737c6436af944774cf24cd731ce048437/1757420145/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757425643","id":257195032,"name":"Feywood Wanderers Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195032/a4800d43c3b87643836017c0a74dd7423c9ef56b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=175